            "text": "I understand you'd like a refund for your office chair (order 1005), but unfortunately I'm unable to process this refund at the moment. \n\nHere's why: Your order is currently **in transit** and hasn't been delivered yet. According to our refund policy, we can only process refunds for orders that have already been delivered.\n\nHowever, the good news is that your order was just purchased 3 days ago, so once it arrives, you'll still be well within the 30-day refund window! \n\n**Here are your options:**\n- **Wait for delivery** and then contact us if you'd still like a refund\n- **Refuse the package** when it arrives, and it will be returned to us automatically\n\nIf you'd prefer to cancel the order before it arrives instead, I'd recommend contacting our customer service team directly, as they may be able to intercept the shipment.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with regarding this order?",
